        {
          "start": 1.23,
          "end": 8.51,
          "text": "Cześć! I am in Bastion Sakwowy, the best time"
        },
        {
          "start": 8.51,
          "end": 10.73,
          "text": "to be in the city, in the golden hour."
        },
        {
          "start": 11.73,
          "end": 15.45,
          "text": "This place was, in the Middle Ages, a"
        },
        {
          "start": 15.45,
          "end": 19.05,
          "text": "gate to the city. It was called Brama Sakwowa."
        },
        {
          "start": 19.05,
          "end": 23.67,
          "text": "The name Sakwowy comes to represent the"
        },
        {
          "start": 23.67,
          "end": 28.61,
          "text": "manufacturers of wallets and pockets that were"
        },
        {
          "start": 28.61,
