          "text": "active in those days around this place."
        },
        {
          "start": 32.21,
          "end": 36.71,
          "text": "From the 16th century, the place changed to be"
        },
        {
          "start": 36.71,
          "end": 43.79,
          "text": "a bastion, meaning a fortified kind of fortress that is"
        },
        {
          "start": 43.79,
          "end": 46.31,
          "text": "part of the defence of the city of Wrocław."
        },
        {
          "start": 47.09,
          "end": 50.65,
          "text": "In the 19th century, the city was conquered by Napoleon's"
        },
        {
          "start": 50.65,
          "end": 57.69,
          "text": "armies, and since then the bastion stopped its role as"
        },
        {
          "start": 57.69,
          "end": 64.23,
          "text": "a defensive fortress of the city of Wrocław. Since then"
        },
        {
          "start": 64.23,
          "end": 68.47,
          "text": "it changed its role and became a very elegant place."
        },
        {
          "start": 68.47,
          "end": 70.95,
          "text": "You can see the fountain behind me and"
        },
        {
          "start": 70.95,
          "end": 74.87,
          "text": "the colonnades, and it looks like a very"
        },
        {
          "start": 74.87,
          "end": 78.79,
          "text": "Italian, elegant place to wander around."
        },
        {
          "start": 79.27,
          "end": 82.15,
          "text": "I also recommend the restaurant on the"
        },
        {
          "start": 82.15,
          "end": 84.99,
          "text": "ground floor called Gustaw, which is highly"
        },
        {
          "start": 84.99,
          "end": 87.41,
          "text": "recommended. So I invite you to come"
        },
        {
          "start": 87.41,
          "end": 93.0,
          "text": "to Bastion Sakwowy at any time of the day, whether it is the morning, noon time,"
        },
        {
          "start": 93.27,
          "end": 96.79,
          "text": "the afternoon, and the best is the golden"
        },
        {
